OL,3,AThe race to stop England running out of
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe race to stop England running out of
OL,7,Fwater
OL,9,FOne evening in early August, farmer
OL,10,FDaniel Sizer's phone buzzed with a
OL,11,Fmessage.
OL,13,FIt was from his local water board and
OL,14,Fit read: "River levels are low but have
OL,15,Frecovered enough to allow one night of
OL,16,Firrigation tonight."
OL,18,FLike much of the lower half of England,
OL,19,FDaniel's fourth-generation farm had
OL,20,Fseen barely any rain in nearly three
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
